#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "Yablonsky AI returned an unsuccessful model-specific response."
msgstr "Yablonsky AI نے مخصوص ماڈل کا ناکام جواب دیا۔"

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
